{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03004","headline":"彭蠡湖上 · 张九龄","name":"彭蠡湖上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沿涉经大湖，湖流多行泆。\n决晨趋北渚，逗浦已西日。\n所适虽淹旷，中流且闲逸。\n瑰诡良复多，感见乃非一。\n庐山直阳浒，孤石当阴术。\n一水云际飞，数峰湖心出。\n象类何交乣，形言岂深悉。\n且知皆自然，高下无相恤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}